<title>UK: TLS says gets possible bid approach.</title>
<headline>TLS says gets possible bid approach.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's TLS Plc said on Wednesday it had received an approach that may or may not lead to an offer being made for the company.</p>
<p>TLS's shares rose 26.5p to 123.5 by 1015 GMT.</p>
<p>TLS hires out commercial and private motor vehicles. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
